; fas9_polyline_owner.scr - facit of what a POLYLINE's VERTEX and SEQEND and an INSERT's ATTRIB and SEQEND have when the owner is changed. Run it with
;   python -I tools/fas9_facit_run.py doc/facit/fas9_polyline_owner.scr
; Files (acad_<version>_dxf_<theme>[_<change>][_bin].dxf):
;   polyline_owner               a 3D polyline, a 2D polyline, a polygon mesh, a polyface mesh, an INSERT with an ATTRIB
;   polyline_owner recolored     all of them color 3
;   polyline_owner relinetyped   all of them linetype DASHED
;   polyline_owner relayered     all of them layer LA
;   polyline_owner reweighted    all of them lineweight 0.5, linetype scale 2, transparency 40
_.PLINETYPE
0
